TY  - GEN
ID  - du-fu-quantum-gln-qschur-survey
AU  - COUNTERPARTS, INFINITE/INFINITESIMAL
TI  - Quantum gl_n, q-Schur algebras and their infinite/infinitesimal counterparts
DA  - D:20071012
AB  - We present a survey of recent developments of the Beilinson–Lusztig–MacPherson approach in the study of quantum gln, inﬁnitesimal quantum gln, quantum gl∞and their associated q-Schur algebras, little q-Schur algebras and inﬁnite q-Schur algebras. We also use the relationship between quantum gl∞and inﬁnite q-Schur algebras to discuss their representations.
ER  - 
